{"page":20094,"part":1,"text":"苏子美论书\n\n苏子美喜论用笔，而书字不迨其所论，岂其力不副其心邪？然“万事以心为本，未有心至而力不能者，”余独以为不然。此所谓非知之难，而行之难者也。古之人不虚劳其心力，故其学精而无不至。盖其幼也，未有所为时，专其力于学书。及其渐长，则其所学渐近于用。今人不然，多学书于晚年，所以与古不同也。","eligible":true,"blockedReasons":[],"source":{"kind":"human-txt","page":20094,"part":1,"label":"wolai标准正文／原人工审核独有补充","verifiedBy":"项目负责人（本对话确认）","verifiedAt":"2026-10-22T07:57:06+00:00","revision":"3c3a75097bcedcd69689c5634ced13ff5c5e494f5352b1bf65697d4df8478005","textSha256":"3c3a75097bcedcd69689c5634ced13ff5c5e494f5352b1bf65697d4df8478005","fileSha256":"3c3a75097bcedcd69689c5634ced13ff5c5e494f5352b1bf65697d4df8478005","txtPath":"annotation-data/wolai-txt/20094-work-105.txt","reviewCsvPath":"annotation-data/wolai-review.csv","standardCorpus":"wolai-standard","displayLabel":"试笔 · 苏子美论书","sourceUrl":"https://www.wolai.com/mojiyi/TApXP9wfa4NHrhzheeU8G","originalPages":[],"positionStatus":"原图只作篇目参考；新版正文不声称与旧扫描逐字对齐","provenance":[{"start":0,"end":5,"sourceTextSha256":"c6639dd7569ff1cf981b0999f995186866caaeaadd11203c4f085527f6d38595","id":"5zeohSPbDLatW5f4pVwyEY","page_id":"TApXP9wfa4NHrhzheeU8G","root_id":"TApXP9wfa4NHrhzheeU8G","work":"试笔","author":"欧阳修","type":"tinyHeader","origin":"wolai-block","rawStart":0,"rawEnd":5},{"start":7,"end":146,"sourceTextSha256":"2e047ee7c0e23842e80386f30b6231e4194ba7b8ed78095d2a6f7a1ec4a270a4","id":"77RVHfzh7RXXF1E4PoQz2o","page_id":"TApXP9wfa4NHrhzheeU8G","root_id":"TApXP9wfa4NHrhzheeU8G","work":"试笔","author":"欧阳修","type":"text","origin":"wolai-block","rawStart":0,"rawEnd":139}]},"segments":[{"start":0,"end":5,"quote":"苏子美论书","role":"structure","category":"篇章标题","note":"来源原有标题","contextStatus":"complete"},{"start":5,"end":7,"quote":"\n\n","role":"structure","category":"段落分隔","note":"展示分隔，不替代来源字符","contextStatus":"complete"},{"start":7,"end":146,"quote":"苏子美喜论用笔，而书字不迨其所论，岂其力不副其心邪？然“万事以心为本，未有心至而力不能者，”余独以为不然。此所谓非知之难，而行之难者也。古之人不虚劳其心力，故其学精而无不至。盖其幼也，未有所为时，专其力于学书。及其渐长，则其所学渐近于用。今人不然，多学书于晚年，所以与古不同也。","role":"theory","category":"学书方法","note":"以苏子美知行之差论习书时间和专精","contex